messages.content:
{
  "message": "Thanks for running those checks. Here’s what I’m seeing and why you have “No Service”: your phone reports the SIM is locked with a PIN. When the SIM is locked, the device cannot register on the network, which results in No Service and no signal bars. Once we unlock the SIM, service should return.",
  "our_thought_process": "Line 555-123-2002 is Active on our side (not suspended), so the network is ready for you. The device shows SIM locked_pin and no signal, which blocks network registration. Reseating the SIM won’t help in this state; the SIM must be unlocked. If you know the SIM PIN, you can unlock immediately on the phone. If you don’t, we’ll need the PUK from support. Don’t guess the PIN—too many wrong attempts permanently lock the SIM until a PUK is entered.",
  "next_steps": [
    "1) Do you know your SIM PIN and do you see how many attempts remain? Please don’t guess if you’re unsure.",
    "2) If you know the PIN, follow the instructions below to unlock. After unlocking, service should return within a minute.",
    "3) If you don’t know the PIN or you’re out of attempts, tell me and I’ll connect you to a human agent to retrieve your PUK and guide you through unlocking."
  ],
  "instructions_to_unlock": {
    "android": [
      "Option A: You may see a notification or lockscreen prompt: “SIM card is locked.” Tap it, choose Unlock, enter your SIM PIN, and confirm.",
      "Option B: Settings > Security (or Security & privacy) > SIM card lock > Toggle ‘Lock SIM card’ OFF or tap ‘Unlock SIM’ > enter your SIM PIN."
    ],
    "iphone": [
      "Settings > Cellular > SIM PIN > Turn SIM PIN OFF (this prompts for the current SIM PIN) and enter your PIN to unlock.",
      "If you see a direct prompt on the screen to unlock the SIM, enter the SIM PIN there."
    ],
    "important": "You typically have 3 attempts. If you enter it incorrectly too many times, the SIM will require a PUK code from support. If you’re not sure of the PIN, stop and tell me."
  },
  "after_you_unlock": [
    "Wait up to 60 seconds to see if signal bars appear.",
    "If still no bars, please run and share results: check_status_bar and check_network_status.",
    "If service returns but data seems off, we’ll fine-tune settings next."
  ],
  "questions": [
    "Do you know your SIM PIN, and how many attempts are shown as remaining?",
    "Would you like to proceed with entering it now, or should I connect you to a human agent to retrieve your PUK?"
  ]
}

