messages.content:
{
  "message": "I can help get your mobile data stable and as fast as possible while you’re in France. Here’s my plan and why: 1) Identify your line so I can check/enable international roaming on our side and confirm you haven’t hit a data cap—both are common causes abroad. 2) Have you run a few quick checks on the phone to make sure roaming is on, the right network mode is selected (4G/5G), and nothing on the device (like VPN or Data Saver) is slowing things down. 3) If you’re at your data limit, I can add extra data (up to 2 GB) or discuss plan options. Please follow the steps below and share the results.",
  "what_im_doing_and_why": [
    "I need your phone number to locate your account/line and verify roaming and data usage.",
    "On-device checks help me see if anything local (like Data Saver, VPN, or network mode) is limiting speed.",
    "If roaming is not enabled on our side, I’ll enable it at no cost so data works properly in France.",
    "If you’ve hit your monthly data limit, I’ll offer options to restore fast data immediately."
  ],
  "need_from_you": {
    "identify_customer": {
      "please_provide": [
        "The phone number of the line that’s slow in France (best option).",
        "If you don’t have the number handy, your customer ID or your full name + date of birth also works."
      ],
      "consent": "If roaming is disabled on your line, may I enable international data roaming at no cost?"
    },
    "on_device_checks": {
      "instructions": [
        "Check Network Status: Please run check_network_status and paste the results (airplane mode, signal strength, network type like 5G/4G/3G, mobile data ON/OFF, and data roaming ON/OFF).",
        "Run a Speed Test: Please run run_speed_test and share the rating (unknown/very poor/poor/fair/good/excellent).",
        "VPN Status: Please run check_vpn_status and let me know if a VPN is connected. If it is, please disconnect it temporarily using disconnect_vpn and tell me if performance improves.",
        "Data Saver: Please run check_data_restriction_status and let me know if Data Saver is ON. If it is, turn it OFF using toggle_data_saver_mode and see if speed improves.",
        "Network Mode Preference: Please run check_network_mode_preference. If it shows 2G or 3G, set it to 4g_5g_preferred using set_network_mode_preference to allow 4G/5G connections.",
        "Roaming Toggle (on the phone): If check_network_status shows Data Roaming is OFF, please turn it ON using toggle_roaming so your phone can use data outside your home network."
      ],
      "notes": [
        "If Airplane mode shows as ON, please turn it OFF using toggle_airplane_mode.",
        "If mobile data shows as OFF, please turn it ON using toggle_data."
      ]
    }
  },
  "after_you_reply": [
    "I will look up your line, verify/enable roaming on our side, and check if you’ve hit your plan’s data limit.",
    "If data limit is reached, I can immediately add up to 2 GB of data at your plan’s per-GB refuel price (I’ll confirm cost before proceeding), or we can discuss plan change options.",
    "I’ll also advise any further device steps (like APN reset and reboot) if needed based on what you report."
  ]
}

