      "Settings path (varies slightly by phone): Settings > Network & Internet (or Connections) > Airplane Mode > OFF."
    ],
    "after_action_check": {
      "action": "check_network_status",
      "what_to_share_back": [
        "Airplane Mode: now OFF?",
