  "reassurance_about_photos": "All steps above only change connection settings. Your photos and other personal data are safe and will not be erased.",
  "extra_tip": "If speeds are still not excellent after these steps, try moving near a window or outdoors briefly to see if signal bars increase—more bars usually means faster data while roaming."
}

