      "step": 3,
      "title": "Check SIM status (don’t enter any PIN/PUK)",
      "why": "A missing, mis-seated, or locked SIM can cause “No Service.”",
      "do_this": "Open Settings and find SIM/Cellular settings. Tell me if it shows Active, Missing, or Locked. If it shows Missing, we may reseat the SIM next. If it shows Locked, please do not try random codes—tell me and I’ll handle next steps."
    },
    {
      "step": 4,
      "title": "Restart the phone",
      "why": "A reboot clears temporary radio/software glitches.",
      "do_this": "Restart your device normally. After it boots, wait up to 1 minute to see if service returns."
    }
