        "Open Settings > Apps > [Your messaging app].",
        "Permissions: make sure Storage (or Photos/Media/Files) and SMS are allowed.",
        "Data usage: ensure Background data is allowed."
      ],
      "iphone": [
        "Open Settings > Privacy & Security > Photos: ensure your messaging app has access (Read and Write).",
        "Open Settings > Privacy & Security > Files and Folders: allow if applicable.",
        "Open Settings > Cellular: ensure your messaging app is allowed to use cellular data."
      ]
    }
  },
  "request": "Please go ahead with the APN reset and reboot, then let me know the results of the web and MMS tests."
}

